{"type":"assistant","uuid":"200275fd-b35c-4bf7-a7be-1a281c0d2ecf","session_id":"74312631-1fe4-4898-9c70-4f4be0a5161e","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"200275fd-b35c-4bf7-a7be-1a281c0d2ecf","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## Summary\n\n**Bug:** `IllegalStateException: Fragment ... number_dialog ... declared target fragment MedicineCreateOrEditFragment ... that does not belong to this FragmentManager!`\n\n**Root Cause:** `MedicineCreateOrEditFragment` is hosted in a `ViewPager` via `FragmentPagerAdapter` in `MedicinesActivity`. When the user taps the '+' or '-' stock button, `showStockDialog()` creates a `NumberPickerDialogFragment` using `getChildFragmentManager()` while setting `this` (the parent fragment) as its target. \n\nThe problem is a **FragmentManager hierarchy mismatch**:\n- The parent fragment is managed by the **parent `FragmentManager`** (via the ViewPager's `FragmentPagerAdapter`)\n- The dialog is added to the **child `FragmentManager`**\n- When the dialog tries to set its target, Android validates that the target belongs to the same `FragmentManager`, which fails\n\n**Fix:** Changed `getChildFragmentManager()` to `getSupportFragmentManager()` in the `showStockDialog()` method (line 486), so both the dialog fragment and its target fragment are managed by the same `FragmentManager` (the parent activity's `FragmentManager`).\n\n**File modified:** `Calendula/src/main/java/es/usc/citius/servando/calendula/fragments/MedicineCreateOrEditFragment.java`\n\n```diff\n- .setFragmentManager(getChildFragmentManager())\n+ .setFragmentManager(getSupportFragmentManager())\n```\n\nThe patch file is saved at `fix.patch`. Note: The build cannot complete verification due to network issues (jcenter is shut down and DNS resolution fails in this environment), but the code change is syntactically correct — `getSupportFragmentManager()` is a standard `Fragment` method and is used extensively throughout this codebase."}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":55665,"output_tokens":373,"cache_read_input_tokens":54496,"total_tokens":56038}}}
